      "instance_name": "two_women",
      "label": "two individuals",
      "description": "Two women are seated closely together, both wearing light-colored headscarves and traditional attire. They appear to be at a press conference, surrounded by microphones from various media outlets. Their facial expressions are serious and somewhat weary, suggesting they are enduring a taxing or uncomfortable situation. The woman on the left has a slightly skeptical or annoyed expression, while the woman on the right has a more stoic, resigned look. They are the central focus of the image, with microphones positioned in front of them, indicating they are being interviewed or addressing the media.",
